        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Florida State Road 922, Bal Harbour Shops, Haulover Park, northeastern Miami-Dade County, Atlantic Ocean, Biscayne Bay\n- Topics: commercial corridors, mall ownership, location\n\nFacts:\n- Florida State Road 922 is an important commercial artery in northeastern Miami-Dade County, with stores lining much of the route.\n- Bal Harbour Shops is located near the eastern terminus of Florida State Road 922.\n- Bal Harbour Shops is owned by the Whitman family and is one of the few remaining family-owned malls in the United States.\n- Haulover Park is located on a shoal between the Atlantic Ocean and Biscayne Bay.\n- Haulover Park is just north of the Broad Causeway, which is Florida State Road 922, and Collins Avenue.",
